{
  "name": "Blood Curse of the Muddled Mind",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you curse a creature that you can see within 30 feet of you that is concentrating on a spell or using a feature that requires Concentration. The target has to make a Charisma Saving Throw. On a failure, the affected creature has Disadvantage on Wisdom, Intelligence, and Concentration Saving Throws until the start of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> This curse lasts for 1 minute. The cursed creature can make a Charisma Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on itself at the start of your next turn on a success.</p>",
